e": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "148759162", "author": {"steamid": "76561198905974265", "personaname": "Niko", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198905974265/", "num_games_owned": 111, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 747, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 287, "last_played": 1698533765, "avatar": "cd9dc4d7c22609d659a327e382b43c725af82811"}, "language": "english", "review": "I bought the game on discount and do not regret a single euro for it.\n\nUser Interface + Graphic + All other visual aspects on TOP (AAA+)\nSounds at master level\ngameplay with different speed moments, from slow to chill to very intense situations.\nThere is no cash shop in the game.\nNo season passes\nNo subscription\nA quick game mode\nGood-looking appearances come from achieving things in the game, not from your wallet.\n\nThere are some things to improve, but they're not that important.\nI would like to see more crosshair customizations.\nAn ability to customise weapon positions and the recoil weapon effect\n\nBut generally, it's a fantastic game, and all that is said in reviews is not true. I am playing as a beginner and have no issue finding players. Simply start the game alone with bots, which are also cool support, and players will join in a few minutes. \n\nDefinitely underrated and hidden gem.", "timestamp_created": 1698102593, "timestamp_updated": 1698102593, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "148754681", "author": {"steamid": "765611981142